   "title": "【富士市】『吉原祇園祭』歴史ある祭礼に触れる!!会場近くの駐車場を事前チェック!!",
   "html": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-white-color has-swl-main-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-2c42010adcf2990de6da681c7a38f760\"><strong>吉原祇園祭2026の開催概要</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://fuji-miru.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gionsai-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"『吉原祇園祭』静岡県富士市\" class=\"wp-image-42405\" srcset=\"https://fuji-miru.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gionsai-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://fuji-miru.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gionsai-300x169.jpg 300w, https://fuji-miru.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gionsai-768x432.jpg 768w, https://fuji-miru.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gionsai.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">吉原商店街・吉原本町通りで、<strong><span class=\"swl-marker mark_yellow\">令和8年6月13日(土)・14日(日)の2日間</span></strong>にわたって開催される吉原祇園祭。吉原本町通りに<strong><span class=\"swl-marker mark_orange\">150店程の露天商</span></strong>が立ち並び、賑わいの様子を見せてくれます。<strong><span class=\"swl-marker mark_green\">迫力満点の山車回し・競演や宮太鼓の競演などを体感</span></strong>できる年に一度の機会です。伝統ある東海一の祇園祭に参加しましょう！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-icon_info wp-block-paragraph\">特に見どころの<strong><span class=\"swl-marker mark_blue\">山車引回しは、13日が2回（13時・18時）、14日が1回（18時）</span></strong>行われます。大変混み合いが予想されますので、怪我の無いよう気を付けながら楽しみましょう！</p>\n\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3261.717824263699!2d138.6812598756503!3d35.163657458232265!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x601a2ad0ae305795%3A0xf9b5e3f4d56e86b6!2z6Z2Z5bKh55yM5a-M5aOr5biCIOWQieWOn-acrOeUuumAmuOCig!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1779686321323!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-all-centered--va is-style-regular\"><table class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\" data-has-cell-bg=\"1\" data-text-color=\"white\"><span class=\"swl-cell-bg has-swl-main-background-color\" data-text-color=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</span><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">行事名</mark></strong></td><td>吉原祇園祭（よしわらぎおんさい）</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\" data-has-cell-bg=\"1\" data-text-color=\"white\"><span class=\"swl-cell-bg has-swl-main-background-color\" data-text-color=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</span><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">開催日</mark></strong></td><td>2026年6月13日(土)・14日(日)</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\" data-has-cell-bg=\"1\" data-text-color=\"white\"><span class=\"swl-cell-bg has-swl-main-background-color\" data-text-color=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</span><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\"><strong>開催場所</strong></mark></td><td>吉原商店街・吉原本町通り</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\" data-has-cell-bg=\"1\" data-text-color=\"white\"><span class=\"swl-cell-bg has-swl-main-background-color\" data-text-color=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</span><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">日程</mark></strong></td><td>【13日(土)】<br>11:00~ 木遣り道中・梯子乗り<br>13:00~ 山車引回し<br>15:00~ 女御興<br>16:00~ 宮太鼓の競演<br>18:00~ 山車引回し<br>20:15~ 山車の競演<br>※露天商（11:00~21:00）花手水めぐり（~21:00）<br><br>【14日(日)】<br>11:00~ 警察音楽隊パレード<br>10:00~ 神興<br>12:00~ けんか神輿<br>18:00~ 山車引回し<br>20:15~ 山車の競演<br>※露天商（11:00~21:00）花手水めぐり（~21:00）</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\" data-has-cell-bg=\"1\" data-text-color=\"white\"><span class=\"swl-cell-bg has-swl-main-background-color\" data-text-color=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</span><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">交通規制</mark></strong></td><td>11:00~21:00まで歩行者天国</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\" data-has-cell-bg=\"1\" data-text-color=\"white\"><span class=\"swl-cell-bg has-swl-main-background-color\" data-text-color=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</span><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">最寄り駅</mark></strong></td><td>吉原本町駅（岳南電車）</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\" data-has-cell-bg=\"1\" data-text-color=\"white\"><span class=\"swl-cell-bg has-swl-main-background-color\" data-text-color=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</span><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-white-color\">電話番号</mark></strong></td><td>0545-51-5227</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<script async src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-3692927438372128\"\n     crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<!-- fuji-miru-01 -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\"\n     style=\"display:block\"\n     data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-3692927438372128\"\n     data-ad-slot=\"1773119073\"\n     data-ad-format=\"auto\"\n     data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins>\n<script>\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>会場周辺の駐車場一覧</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-icon_announce wp-block-paragraph\">吉原祇園祭当日は大変混み合うので、会場まで徒歩で行ける距離にある駐車場は直ぐに満車になる可能性があります。来場の際は、出来る限り<strong><span class=\"swl-marker mark_green\">公共交通機関の岳南電車（吉原本町駅下車）等の利用がおすすめ</span></strong>です。</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"c-scrollHint sp_\"><span>スクロールできます <i class=\"icon-more_arrow\"></i></span></div>\n<figure data-table-scrollable=\"sp\" class=\"wp-block-table is-style-regular is-all-centered--va min_width10_\"><table style=\"--table-width:800px;\"><thead><tr><th><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">駐車場名</span></th><th><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">住所</span></th><th><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">料金</span></th><th><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">台数</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>富士市吉原本町駐車場</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/thG7hA9k1RrNVkpc7\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/thG7hA9k1RrNVkpc7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市御幸町2-19</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【50分】100円<br>※最大料金適用有り</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">82台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>タイムズ富士吉原</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/DLGYPHhVG1QaHqKQA\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/DLGYPHhVG1QaHqKQA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市吉原4丁目1</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">■最大料金<br>【6:00~17:00】330円<br>【17:00~6:00】770円<br>■通常料金<br>【60分】330円</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">16台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>ほんいちパーキング</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZZtmRCd9FKZ1JKdP8\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZZtmRCd9FKZ1JKdP8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市吉原2丁目11-33</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【30分】100円</span></td><td>&#8211;</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>ほんいちパーキング2</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/7ZhD8Quthc7Zwvap8\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/7ZhD8Quthc7Zwvap8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市吉原2丁目9-23</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【30分】100円</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">34台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>東洋カーマックス吉原駐車場</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/suUKL3cp92zUswFR7\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/suUKL3cp92zUswFR7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市吉原2丁目4-4</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">■最大料金<br>【24時間】1000円<br>■通常料金（土日祝）<br>【30分】100円</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">12台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>吉原中央パーキング</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/NUYBpKns4EgSvhKW7\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/NUYBpKns4EgSvhKW7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市吉原3丁目7ｰ14</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【1時間】200円</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">19台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>虹いろーどパーキング</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Sv7oyGa4qGEYPH2r8\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Sv7oyGa4qGEYPH2r8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市中央町1丁目6-16</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【30分】100円（最大1,000円）</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">44台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>タイムズ富士宮信用金庫吉原支店</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/7cVbcrjQVhKYSR116\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/7cVbcrjQVhKYSR116\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市中央町3丁目12</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【24時間最大】1,000円<br>【60分】220円</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">19台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>しずなびパーキング吉原本町駅前</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/4V3whQqcCYUv8e1Y7\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/4V3whQqcCYUv8e1Y7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市南町3-3</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">■最大料金<br>【24時間】500円（5~7番）、600円（1~4番）<br>【19:00~7:00】400円<br>■通常料金<br>【7:00~19:00】30分100円<br>【19:00~7:00】60分100円</span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">7台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>富士市南町公園駐車場</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/5UeVJ5CFfRvNQaQf8\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/5UeVJ5CFfRvNQaQf8\">富士市御幸町6-38</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【50分】100円<br>※最大料金適用有り</span></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">28台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>富士市和田駐車場</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/XFJwKK2g3PDr2Yp5A\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/XFJwKK2g3PDr2Yp5A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市今泉1丁目1-2</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【50分】100円<br>※最大料金適用有り</span></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">79台</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><strong>杉山駐車場</strong></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/KVKhYjxEsZY72u1L9\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/KVKhYjxEsZY72u1L9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">富士市今泉1丁目10-28</a></span></td><td><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-s\">【7:00~19:00】1時間100円（最大700円）<br>【19:00~7:00】300円均一前払い（自動支払い）</span></td><td>&#8211;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"swell-block-postLink\">\t\t\t<div class=\"p-blogCard -internal\" data-type=\"type1\" data-onclick=\"clickLink\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-blogCard__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"p-blogCard__caption\">あわせて読みたい</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-blogCard__thumb c-postThumb\"><figu